 "limits": "Whole-frame fingerprints cannot name a ship from one frame. Run as planned, the method gave no answer on 97.1% of exterior and 98.2% of interior test frames. Forced to answer, it finds the ship family more often than the exact ship, interiors more often than exteriors, many frames more often than one, and it names one of the covered ships for anything it has never seen. Nothing was tested on a real game screen. Read report.md before using any table.",
